{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "d53e86ea-f2bd-4d8a-b930-e44ec21cba26",
    "name": "PokeTeamGuess API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "PokeTeamGuess — API REST (Spring Boot, sessão HTTP).\n\n**Auth:** cookie `JSESSIONID` + session binding (mesmo User-Agent em todos os pedidos após o Login).\n\n**Fluxo sugerido**\n1. `Auth → Register` → `Auth → Login`\n2. `Meta → PokeTeamGuess (info)` (público)\n3. `Profile → Me` / `Collection` / `Training team`\n4. `Pokedex → Listar (paginado)` ou `Listar tudo`\n5. `Pokemon → Sorteio por Pokébola` (consome inventário)\n6. `Pokemon → PC` (linhas evolutivas + XP)\n\n**Público:** `GET /api/meta`, `POST /auth/register`, `POST /auth/login`, `GET /auth/session`, `POST /auth/logout`\n\n**Autenticado:** perfil, Pokédex, PC, sorteio, `/api/me`"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Registo, login e gestão de conta. Após Login, o cookie é guardado automaticamente pelo Postman.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"username\": \"treinador1\",\n  \"email\": \"treinador1@example.com\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register",
            "description": "Cria utilizador. Body: `username`, `email`, `password` (6–72 caracteres).\n\nResposta 200: `{ userId, email, username }`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Resposta register\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"userId\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"email\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"username\");",
                  "});",
                  "if (j.email) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"authEmail\", j.email);",
                  "if (j.username) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"authUsername\", j.username);",
                  "if (j.userId) pm.collectionVariables.set(\"userId\", j.userId);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"login\": \"{{authEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login",
            "description": "`login`: e-mail **ou** username (`{{authEmail}}` / `{{authUsername}}`).\n\nDefine cookie de sessão — execute antes dos pedidos `/api/*`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Session (status)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/session",
            "description": "Público. `{ authenticated: boolean, ... }` — estado da sessão atual."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test(\"Campo authenticated\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.have.property(\"authenticated\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Change password (logado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"currentPassword\": \"123456\",\n  \"newPassword\": \"654321\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/password",
            "description": "Sessão + session binding. Body: `currentPassword`, `newPassword`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Change username (logado)",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"newUsername\": \"treinador2\",\n  \"password\": \"123456\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/username",
            "description": "Body: `newUsername`, `password` (confirmação)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/logout"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": ["pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Conta",
      "description": "Identidade na sessão (`/api/me`).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /api/me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/me",
            "description": "Resumo da conta: `authenticatedAs`, `userId`, `username`, `email`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Campos /api/me\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"authenticatedAs\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"userId\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"username\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"email\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /api/me (User-Agent diferente → 401)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" },
              { "key": "User-Agent", "value": "Postman-SessionBinding-Test/1.0" }
            ],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/me",
            "description": "Teste de session binding: mesmo cookie, User-Agent alterado → 401 `SESSION_BINDING_MISMATCH`."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 401\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Erro API\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"code\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"message\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Meta",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "PokeTeamGuess (info)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "Accept-Language", "value": "pt-BR" }],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/meta",
            "description": "**Público.** Constantes do cliente:\n- `name`, `summary`\n- `pokedexDefaultPageSize` (20), `pokedexMaxPageSize` (100)\n- `pcPageSize` / `pcMaxPageSize` (50)\n- `fragmentsPerPokeBall` (10)"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test(\"Status 200\", () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test(\"Meta do jogo\", () => {",
                  "    pm.expect(j.name).to.eql(\"PokeTeamGuess\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"pokedexDefaultPageSize\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"pcPageSize\");",
                  "    pm.expect(j).to.have.property(\"fragmentsPerPokeBall\");",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Profile",
      "description": "Perfil de jogo (criado automaticamente no primeiro acesso autenticado).",
      "item": [
        {
